  "trecho": "seção 11 (células 191 a 202)"
 },
 "html": "<p>As seções anteriores mostram <strong>qual gráfico usar em cada análise</strong>. Esta seção reúne <strong>como construir, combinar e formatar</strong> gráficos.</p>\n<h2 id=\"secao-11-1\">11.1 Qual gráfico usar?</h2>\n<div aria-label=\"11.1 Qual gráfico usar?\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Objetivo</th>\n<th>Gráfico</th>\n<th>Função seaborn / matplotlib</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Distribuição de 1 numérica</td>\n<td>histograma, KDE, boxplot, violino</td>\n<td><code>histplot</code>, <code>kdeplot</code>, <code>boxplot</code>, <code>violinplot</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frequência de categorias</td>\n<td>barras (horizontais se rótulos longos)</td>\n<td><code>countplot</code>, <code>barplot</code>, <code>ax.barh</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Comparar numérica entre grupos</td>\n<td>boxplot, violino, strip/swarm, barras com erro</td>\n<td><code>boxplot</code>, <code>violinplot</code>, <code>stripplot</code>, <code>swarmplot</code>, <code>barplot</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Relação entre 2 numéricas</td>\n<td>dispersão, hexbin, histograma 2D, regressão</td>\n<td><code>scatterplot</code>, <code>jointplot</code>, <code>histplot(x, y)</code>, <code>regplot</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Relação entre várias numéricas</td>\n<td>pairplot, heatmap de correlação</td>\n<td><code>pairplot</code>, <code>heatmap</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Métrica por 2 categorias</td>\n<td>heatmap de tabela dinâmica</td>\n<td><code>pivot_table</code> + <code>heatmap</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Evolução no tempo</td>\n<td>linhas</td>\n<td><code>lineplot</code>, <code>Series.plot()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Proporções entre grupos</td>\n<td>barras 100% empilhadas</td>\n<td><code>crosstab(normalize=...).plot(kind='barh', stacked=True)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<h2 id=\"secao-11-2\">11.2 Estrutura matplotlib: figura, eixos e formatação</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> <code>fig, ax = plt.subplots()</code> cria uma figura (<code>fig</code>) e um ou mais eixos (<code>ax</code>). Funções seaborn <em>axes-level</em> desenham no eixo indicado por <code>ax=</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> é o padrão de todos os gráficos, porque dá controle total sobre tamanho, título, eixos e grade de vários gráficos.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># Grade de gráficos: percorra os eixos com axes.flat</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">fig, axes = plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">subplots</span>(nrows=<span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>, ncols=<span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>, figsize=(<span class=\"tk-num\">12</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">7</span>), sharex=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">colunas = [<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_valor</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">duracao_dias</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> ax, coluna <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> <span class=\"tk-bi\">zip</span>(axes.flat, colunas):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">    sns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">histplot</span>(data=df, x=coluna, ax=ax, kde=<span class=\"tk-kw\">True</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">    ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">axvline</span>(df[coluna].<span class=\"tk-fn\">median</span>(), color=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">red</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, linestyle=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">--</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, label=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">mediana</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)  <span class=\"tk-com\"># linha de referência</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">    ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_title</span>(coluna)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">    ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">legend</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">fig.<span class=\"tk-fn\">suptitle</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Distribuição das variáveis numéricas</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, fontsize=<span class=\"tk-num\">14</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">tight_layout</span>()       <span class=\"tk-com\"># evita sobreposição de títulos e rótulos</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">show</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><figure class=\"figura\"><button aria-label=\"Ampliar imagem: Grade de quatro histogramas com KDE, um para cada variável numérica (coluna_num, coluna_num_2, coluna_valor e duracao_dias), cada um com uma linha tracejada na mediana. Título: Distribuição das variáveis numéricas.\" class=\"figura__ampliar\" data-ampliar=\"\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Grade de quatro histogramas com KDE, um para cada variável numérica (coluna_num, coluna_num_2, coluna_valor e duracao_dias), cada um com uma linha tracejada na mediana. Título: Distribuição das variáveis numéricas.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1032\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/notebook/celula-192.webp\" width=\"1776\"/><span class=\"figura__icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path></svg></span></button></figure></div>\n<h3 id=\"grafico-de-apresentacao-pronto-para-relatorio\">Gráfico de apresentação (pronto para relatório)</h3>\n<p>Ranking em barras horizontais, ordenado, com rótulos, fonte dos dados e exportação.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">ranking = df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_cat</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">value_counts</span>().<span class=\"tk-fn\">head</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">12</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">fig, ax = plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">subplots</span>(figsize=(<span class=\"tk-num\">12</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">5</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">barh</span>(ranking.index, ranking.values, color=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">#2a9d8f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">invert_yaxis</span>()                                     <span class=\"tk-com\"># maior no topo</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">bar_label</span>(ax.containers[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>], fmt=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%d</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, padding=<span class=\"tk-num\">3</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_xlabel</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Número de registros</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_title</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Registros por categoria (</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>PERIODO<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, loc=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">left</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, fontsize=<span class=\"tk-num\">14</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">grid</span>(axis=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">x</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, color=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">gray</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, linestyle=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">--</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, linewidth=<span class=\"tk-num\">0.5</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">ax.<span class=\"tk-fn\">grid</span>(axis=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">y</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, visible=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">sns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">despine</span>(left=<span class=\"tk-kw\">True</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">fig.<span class=\"tk-fn\">text</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">0.99</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">0.01</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Fonte: nome_da_fonte</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, ha=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">right</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, fontsize=<span class=\"tk-num\">8</span>, color=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">gray</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\">PASTA_SAIDA.<span class=\"tk-fn\">mkdir</span>(exist_ok=<span class=\"tk-kw\">True</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\">fig.<span class=\"tk-fn\">savefig</span>(CAMINHO_SAIDA_GRAFICO, dpi=<span class=\"tk-num\">150</span>, bbox_inches=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">tight</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)   <span class=\"tk-com\"># bbox_inches evita cortar rótulos</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">show</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><figure class=\"figura\"><button aria-label=\"Ampliar imagem: Gráfico de apresentação: barras horizontais ordenadas com o número de registros por categoria, maior no topo, com o valor ao fim de cada barra, grade vertical discreta e nota de fonte no canto inferior direito.\" class=\"figura__ampliar\" data-ampliar=\"\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Gráfico de apresentação: barras horizontais ordenadas com o número de registros por categoria, maior no topo, com o valor ao fim de cada barra, grade vertical discreta e nota de fonte no canto inferior direito.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"741\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/notebook/celula-194.webp\" width=\"1788\"/><span class=\"figura__icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path></svg></span></button></figure></div>\n<p><strong>Formatação frequente</strong></p>\n<div aria-label=\"Formatação frequente\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Tarefa</th>\n<th>Código</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Título da figura / do eixo</td>\n<td><code>fig.suptitle('...')</code> / <code>ax.set_title('...')</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rótulos dos eixos</td>\n<td><code>ax.set_xlabel('...')</code>, <code>ax.set_ylabel('...')</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Girar rótulos</td>\n<td><code>plt.xticks(rotation=45, ha='right')</code> ou <code>ax.tick_params(axis='x', rotation=45)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Renomear rótulos de categorias</td>\n<td><code>ax.set_xticks(ax.get_xticks(), ['Rótulo 1', 'Rótulo 2'])</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Limites dos eixos (zoom)</td>\n<td><code>ax.set_xlim(0, 100)</code>, <code>ax.set_ylim(0, 50_000)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Escala log</td>\n<td><code>ax.set_xscale('log')</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linhas de referência</td>\n<td><code>ax.axvline(x)</code>, <code>ax.axhline(y)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Texto / nota de fonte</td>\n<td><code>ax.text(x, y, '...')</code>, <code>fig.text(x, y, '...')</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Valores nas barras</td>\n<td><code>ax.bar_label(ax.containers[0], fmt='%.1f')</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Legenda fora do gráfico</td>\n<td><code>ax.legend(bbox_to_anchor=(1.02, 1), loc='upper left')</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tamanho do marcador / transparência</td>\n<td><code>s=20</code>, <code>alpha=0.5</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gráfico rápido direto do pandas</td>\n<td><code>df.plot(x='coluna_1', y='coluna_2', kind='bar')</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<h2 id=\"secao-11-3\">11.3 Funções <em>axes-level</em> × <em>figure-level</em> e grades</h2>\n<div aria-label=\"11.3 Funções axes-level × figure-level e grades\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Axes-level (aceita <code>ax=</code>)</th>\n<th>Figure-level (cria a própria figura, aceita <code>col=</code>/<code>row=</code>)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>histplot</code>, <code>kdeplot</code>, <code>ecdfplot</code></td>\n<td><code>displot</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>scatterplot</code>, <code>lineplot</code></td>\n<td><code>relplot</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>boxplot</code>, <code>violinplot</code>, <code>stripplot</code>, <code>swarmplot</code>, <code>barplot</code>, <code>countplot</code></td>\n<td><code>catplot(kind=...)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>regplot</code></td>\n<td><code>lmplot</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-</td>\n<td><code>pairplot</code>, <code>jointplot</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo callout__titulo--so-icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">Atenção</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><p>Funções <em>figure-level</em> <strong>não aceitam <code>ax=</code></strong> e retornam um objeto de grade (<code>FacetGrid</code>, <code>PairGrid</code>, <code>JointGrid</code>). O tamanho é controlado por <code>height</code> (altura de cada painel) e <code>aspect</code> (largura = height × aspect), não por <code>figsize</code>.</p></div></aside>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># catplot: qualquer gráfico categórico, facetado por outra variável</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">g = sns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">catplot</span>(data=df, x=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_cat</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, y=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, col=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_cat_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, kind=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">box</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">                order=[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">A</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">B</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">C</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>], height=<span class=\"tk-num\">4</span>, aspect=<span class=\"tk-num\">1.1</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">g.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_titles</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_cat_2 = </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{col_name}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">show</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><figure class=\"figura\"><button aria-label=\"Ampliar imagem: Dois painéis de boxplots de coluna_num por categoria A, B e C, um para cada valor de coluna_cat_2.\" class=\"figura__ampliar\" data-ampliar=\"\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Dois painéis de boxplots de coluna_num por categoria A, B e C, um para cada valor de coluna_cat_2.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/notebook/celula-197.webp\" width=\"1329\"/><span class=\"figura__icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path></svg></span></button></figure></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># FacetGrid: aplica qualquer função de gráfico a cada combinação de linha/coluna</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">g = sns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">FacetGrid</span>(df, col=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_cat_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, row=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">nivel</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, hue=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_binaria</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, height=<span class=\"tk-num\">3</span>, aspect=<span class=\"tk-num\">1.4</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">g.<span class=\"tk-fn\">map_dataframe</span>(sns.scatterplot, x=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, y=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, alpha=<span class=\"tk-num\">0.5</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">g.<span class=\"tk-fn\">add_legend</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">show</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><figure class=\"figura\"><button aria-label=\"Ampliar imagem: Grade de quatro gráficos de dispersão de coluna_num contra coluna_num_2: colunas pelos grupos de coluna_cat_2, linhas pelos níveis acima e abaixo da mediana, com cores por coluna_binaria e legenda.\" class=\"figura__ampliar\" data-ampliar=\"\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Grade de quatro gráficos de dispersão de coluna_num contra coluna_num_2: colunas pelos grupos de coluna_cat_2, linhas pelos níveis acima e abaixo da mediana, com cores por coluna_binaria e legenda.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"876\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/notebook/celula-198.webp\" width=\"1458\"/><span class=\"figura__icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path></svg></span></button></figure></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># PairGrid: um tipo de gráfico diferente na diagonal, acima e abaixo dela</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">g = sns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">PairGrid</span>(df[[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">log_coluna_num</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]].<span class=\"tk-fn\">dropna</span>(), height=<span class=\"tk-num\">2.5</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">g.<span class=\"tk-fn\">map_diag</span>(sns.histplot)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">g.<span class=\"tk-fn\">map_upper</span>(sns.scatterplot, alpha=<span class=\"tk-num\">0.3</span>, s=<span class=\"tk-num\">10</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">g.<span class=\"tk-fn\">map_lower</span>(sns.kdeplot, fill=<span class=\"tk-kw\">True</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">show</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><figure class=\"figura\"><button aria-label=\"Ampliar imagem: Grade 3 × 3 com coluna_num, coluna_num_2 e log_coluna_num: histogramas na diagonal, dispersões acima dela e curvas de densidade preenchidas abaixo.\" class=\"figura__ampliar\" data-ampliar=\"\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Grade 3 × 3 com coluna_num, coluna_num_2 e log_coluna_num: histogramas na diagonal, dispersões acima dela e curvas de densidade preenchidas abaixo.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1095\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/notebook/celula-199.webp\" width=\"1088\"/><span class=\"figura__icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path></svg></span></button></figure></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--alternativa\"><p class=\"callout__titulo callout__titulo--so-icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 3v12\"></path><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"6\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M18 9a9 9 0 0 1-9 9\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">Alternativa</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><p><strong><code>sns.JointGrid(data=df, x=..., y=...)</code></strong> é a versão configurável do <code>jointplot</code>: <code>g.plot(sns.regplot, sns.histplot)</code> define o gráfico central e o das margens. <code>g.plot_joint(...)</code> e <code>g.plot_marginals(...)</code> adicionam camadas, como na Seção <a href=\"/explorar/analise-bivariada-e-multivariada/#secao-8-2\">8.2</a>.</p></div></aside>\n<h2 id=\"secao-11-4\">11.4 Estilos, contexto e cores</h2>\n<div aria-label=\"11.4 Estilos, contexto e cores\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Função</th>\n<th>Controla</th>\n<th>Opções</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sns.set_theme(style=, context=, palette=)</code></td>\n<td>tudo de uma vez</td>\n<td>ver abaixo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sns.set_style()</code></td>\n<td>fundo e grade</td>\n<td><code>'whitegrid'</code>, <code>'darkgrid'</code>, <code>'white'</code>, <code>'dark'</code>, <code>'ticks'</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sns.set_context()</code></td>\n<td>escala de fontes e linhas</td>\n<td><code>'paper'</code> &lt; <code>'notebook'</code> &lt; <code>'talk'</code> &lt; <code>'poster'</code> (+ <code>font_scale=</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sns.despine()</code></td>\n<td>remove bordas superior/direita (<code>left=True</code> remove a esquerda)</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>palette=</code></td>\n<td>cores</td>\n<td>qualitativa: <code>'deep'</code>, <code>'Set1'</code>, <code>'Set2'</code>; sequencial: <code>'viridis'</code>, <code>'Blues'</code>, <code>'magma'</code>; divergente: <code>'RdBu_r'</code>, <code>'coolwarm'</code>; lista própria: <code>['#acacac', '#34ba34']</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>O que observar</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><ul>\n<li>Escolha o tipo de paleta pelo tipo de dado: <strong>qualitativa</strong> para categorias, <strong>sequencial</strong> para intensidade e <strong>divergente</strong> para valores com um centro (como a correlação, centrada em 0).</li>\n<li>Evite <code>'rainbow'</code> / <code>'jet'</code>: distorcem a percepção e não são acessíveis para daltônicos.</li>\n<li>Use <code>hue_order</code> / <code>order</code> para manter cores e ordem <strong>consistentes</strong> entre gráficos.</li>\n<li>Para destacar um grupo, pinte-o com uma cor forte e deixe os demais em cinza (<code>palette=['#acacac', '#34ba34']</code>).</li>\n</ul></div></aside>\n<h2 id=\"secao-11-5\">11.5 Funções e parâmetros desatualizados</h2>\n<p>Material antigo usa funções que foram removidas ou geram avisos nas versões atuais:</p>\n<div aria-label=\"11.5 Funções e parâmetros desatualizados\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Antigo</th>\n<th>Atual</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sns.distplot(x)</code></td>\n<td><code>sns.histplot(x, kde=True)</code> ou <code>sns.displot(...)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sns.distplot(x, kde=False, bins=30)</code></td>\n<td><code>sns.histplot(x, bins=30)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sns.factorplot(...)</code></td>\n<td><code>sns.catplot(...)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>size=</code> em <code>lmplot</code>/<code>catplot</code></td>\n<td><code>height=</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>violinplot(bw=...)</code></td>\n<td><code>violinplot(bw_adjust=...)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>barplot(..., palette=...)</code> sem <code>hue</code></td>\n<td><code>barplot(..., hue=&lt;mesma variável de x&gt;, palette=..., legend=False)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>barplot(ci='sd')</code></td>\n<td><code>barplot(errorbar='sd')</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>df.corr()</code> com colunas de texto</td>\n<td><code>df.corr(numeric_only=True)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>np.NaN</code></td>\n<td><code>np.nan</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>df.select_dtypes('object')</code> para texto</td>\n<td><code>df.select_dtypes(exclude='number')</code>, que funciona no pandas 2 e 3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n",
